  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Triple Benefit Programme-Land to Sea (TBP-L2S)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tripple benfiit program i sbeing funded by DANIDA through WWF DK. The project is being implemented in 6 countries (Kenya, Madagascar, Uganda, Myanmar, Vietnam and Nepal. The aim of the Triple Benefit Program (TBP) is to achieve improved human well-being, thriving biodiversity and enhanced climate mitigation &amp; resilience for people and nature in countries of intervention. The TBP centers around pioneering and scaling Nature-based Solutions (NbS) as a cross-cutting methodology.</narrative>
  </description>
